Package: kggplot
Title: Concise, Composable 'ggplot2' Plots from a Single Call
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kevin Bosirany", "Orlando", , "kevinbosirany@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-2784-3108"))
Description: Draw a complete 'ggplot2' graphic (data reshaping, mappings,
    geometry, labels, theme, palette, legend, facets) with a single short
    call, and compose plots with the '+' operator through the 'kggplot' S3
    class. Plot types, themes and palettes live in extensible registries.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: 
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    grDevices,
    rlang,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests: 
    ggConvexHull,
    InraeThemes,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
